{{- /* Time-limit notice (en). The opening doubles as the "already there" marker; see internal/i18n/protocol.go. */ -}}
This job's time limit is {{ .Limit }}, counted from the moment it starts running (queue and lock wait do not count); the deadline instant is the value of ${{ .Env }}, and `gofer job show $GOFER_JOB_ID` shows it too. When the limit gets close, commit what is finished first and say in your report what is left.
